<BaseLayout title="About — Sarh Al Elm Private School" lang="en">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">About Us</p><h1>A community built on strong foundations</h1><p class="sub">Established in 2004, Sarh Al Elm serves learners from Kindergarten 1 and 2 through Grade 8 in Muscat.</p></div></section>
  <section class="block wrap two-col"><div><h2>Our story</h2><p>Established in 2004, Sarh Al Elm Private School has served families in South Al Mawaleh for more than two decades. The school welcomes Omani and expatriate learners from Kindergarten 1 and 2 through Grade 8.</p><p>Our name — meaning “the edifice of knowledge” — reflects the idea that learning is built step by step. We aim to provide a purposeful bilingual school experience in which students build knowledge, communication skills, confidence and positive learning habits.</p><h2 class="mt">Our educational approach</h2><p>We seek to keep pace with developments in education through modern teaching strategies, educational resources and interactive learning technologies. Our approach supports the wider goals of Oman Vision 2040 by valuing education, innovation, capable people and sustainable national development.</p></div><div><h2>Our mission</h2><p>We aim to develop confident, capable learners who think critically, communicate in both Arabic and English, and carry strong values into whatever they pursue next.</p><h2 class="mt">Curriculum information</h2><p>Sarh Al Elm teaches the Oman Ministry of Education Mathematics and Science curriculum and learning resources developed through the Ministry’s partnership with Cambridge University Press & Assessment.</p><a class="text-link" href="/academics/">Explore academics →</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.page-hero{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(4,34,62,.92),rgba(4,34,62,.62)),url('/images/school/03-school-celebration.jpg') center 60%/cover;color:#fff;padding:92px 0}.page-hero .eyebrow{color:#d5a43f;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px}.page-hero h1{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,52px);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:14px;max-width:640px}.page-hero .sub{color:#eef5fb;max-width:560px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7}.block{padding:64px 24px}.two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px}h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:22px;margin-bottom:12px;color:var(--navy-dark)}h2.mt{margin-top:28px}p{color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px}.text-link{color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}@media(max-width:800px){.page-hero{padding:70px 0;background-position:center}.two-col{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>